# v0.2 Gate A-yz (2 Nov 2026): checks/08_gateA_rebox/in.measure plus sigma_yz by surface forces along z on the same slabs.
# Read a slab whose box strain was set by tools/rebox.py, apply surface forces (x: sigma_xy, z: sigma_yz), relax, and print
# the interior stress exactly as in.measure (same groups, averaging, minimiser). Vars: tag datain exx ezz sxy syz
variable        a equal 2.8553
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
boundary        p s p
read_data       ${datain}
read_data       yz_chi+0_syz+0_tau2.7_it1.data
